      "abstract": "<jats:p>The infrared spectrum of formic acid vapor at 150\u00b0C has been studied over the 1800\u20131250 cm\u20141 region. A vibrational assignment has been made for monomeric formic acid and the anomalous frequency shifts in the three deuterated isotopic acids explained on this assignment by considering vibrational interaction.</jats:p>",
